    "detailed_description": "I drew a game console at the company's annual meeting and went home to try out a new game, only to find that I had entered the world of the game\u2026<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a rough short visual novel created by someone due to interest. It tells a story of saving another world in the game. This game clearly pays a tribute to other two games that exist on Steam, which are perhaps related to love simulation.<br />\r\nThis game has minor branches, with only three options and four endings.<br />\r\n*WARNING! The art and music resources in the work contain relatively low-quality materials generated by AI. The voice in the game may make player feel uncomfortable, thus it is off in default condition.<br />\r\n*This work may be male-oriented and may cause psychological discomfort to some people. Please purchase with caution.<br />\r\n*Due to some reasons, some images in the game may be inconsistent with the text description.",
